# A cold reset powers the Multi-device off and on with the ST (emumd): the RP
# boots again and shows the setup menu, even after [F]irmware, and the ST says
# hello once more; it boots once, not in a loop (two hellos only, checked by
# the harness's caller from hatari.out).
text "Machine +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key e
screen same userfw 300
reset cold
newlog "Cartridge image in RAM verified" 500
newlog "Setting shared variable 1 to" 1500
text "Select an option" 500
text "Machine +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 500
wait 500
shot after
